       "id": "2124270846588101041",
       "text": "Every photograph ever taken of Uranus up close was taken in about five and a half hours, on one day in January 1986.\n\nVoyager 2 had flown for eight years to get there. In one pass it found 10 new moons, two new rings, and a magnetic field knocked far off the planet's axis.\n\nOn https://t.co/WhgmHyOcn9",
