      {
       "id": "2124249073377009856",
       "text": "Elon Musk just made the case for going back to Uranus: \"It's high time we probed Uranus again!\"\n\nYes, he followed it with \"(actually)\", because the joke writes itself. But his real point stands: \"Much better images are needed.\"\n\nHere's why he has a point:\n\n\u2022 Only one spacecraft",
